{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLoaderDeps"},{"type":"text","value":" hook is a hook that returns an object with the dependencies that are used to trigger the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"loader"},{"type":"text","value":" for a given route."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"useloaderdepshook-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useLoaderDepsHook options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLoaderDepsHook"},{"type":"text","value":" hook accepts an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-from-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.from"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The RouteID or path to get the loader dependencies from."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-select-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.select"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(deps: TLoaderDeps) => TSelected"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If supplied, this function will be called with the loader dependencies object and the return value will be returned from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLoaderDeps"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-structuralsharing-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.structuralSharing"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guide/render-optimizations.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Render Optimizations guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for more information."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"useloaderdeps-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useLoaderDeps returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An object of the loader dependencies or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":" if a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" function is provided."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useLoaderDeps } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst routeApi = getRouteApi('/posts/$postId')\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const deps = useLoaderDeps({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n\n  // OR\n\n  const routeDeps = routeApi.useLoaderDeps()\n\n  // OR\n\n  const postId = useLoaderDeps({\n    from: '/posts',\n    select: (deps) => deps.view,\n  })\n\n  // ...\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"useloaderdepshook-options","text":"useLoaderDepsHook options","level":2},{"id":"opts-from-option","text":"opts.from option","level":3},{"id":"opts-select-option","text":"opts.select option","level":3},{"id":"opts-structuralsharing-option","text":"opts.structuralSharing option","level":3},{"id":"useloaderdeps-returns","text":"useLoaderDeps returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `useLoaderDeps` hook is a hook that returns an object with the dependencies that are used to trigger the `loader` for a given route.\n\n## useLoaderDepsHook options\n\nThe `useLoaderDepsHook` hook accepts an `options` object.\n\n### `opts.from` option\n\n- Type: `string`\n- Required\n- The RouteID or path to get the loader dependencies from.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Type: `(deps: TLoaderDeps) => TSelected`\n- Optional\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the loader dependencies object and the return value will be returned from `useLoaderDeps`.\n\n### `opts.structuralSharing` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by `select`.\n- See the [Render Optimizations guide](../../guide/render-optimizations.md) for more information.\n\n## useLoaderDeps returns\n\n- An object of the loader dependencies or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useLoaderDeps } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst routeApi = getRouteApi('/posts/$postId')\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const deps = useLoaderDeps({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n\n  // OR\n\n  const routeDeps = routeApi.useLoaderDeps()\n\n  // OR\n\n  const postId = useLoaderDeps({\n    from: '/posts',\n    select: (deps) => deps.view,\n  })\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useLoaderDepsHook\ntitle: useLoaderDeps hook\n---\n\nThe `useLoaderDeps` hook is a hook that returns an object with the dependencies that are used to trigger the `loader` for a given route.\n\n## useLoaderDepsHook options\n\nThe `useLoaderDepsHook` hook accepts an `options` object.\n\n### `opts.from` option\n\n- Type: `string`\n- Required\n- The RouteID or path to get the loader dependencies from.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Type: `(deps: TLoaderDeps) => TSelected`\n- Optional\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the loader dependencies object and the return value will be returned from `useLoaderDeps`.\n\n### `opts.structuralSharing` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by `select`.\n- See the [Render Optimizations guide](../../guide/render-optimizations.md) for more information.\n\n## useLoaderDeps returns\n\n- An object of the loader dependencies or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useLoaderDeps } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst routeApi = getRouteApi('/posts/$postId')\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const deps = useLoaderDeps({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n\n  // OR\n\n  const routeDeps = routeApi.useLoaderDeps()\n\n  // OR\n\n  const postId = useLoaderDeps({\n    from: '/posts',\n    select: (deps) => deps.view,\n  })\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n"}
